---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME, BASE } from '../site';
const faqs=[
 ['How much does a website cost?','Every project is quoted — there is no fixed price list, because no two businesses need the same site. Tell us your budget in the form and we will tell you what fits, in writing, before you commit to anything. What changes the price: number of pages, a store or app, and whether you need hosting and care after launch.'],
 ['How long does it take?','Most websites: 4–6 weeks from first call to launch. A focused build with ready content: 3 weeks. Larger builds: 8–12 weeks.'],
 ['Do you work outside Canada?','Yes — we are based in Canada and work worldwide, in your time zone.'],
 ['Who owns the website?','You do. Domain, website, content and data — all in your accounts, in your name. No lock-in.'],
 ['What happens after launch?','Care plans cover hosting, updates, backups and small changes. Cancel anytime with 30 days notice.'],
 ['I am not technical. Will I understand what is happening?','Yes — that is the point. You get one person to talk to, plain-English updates, and a site you can edit yourself. You never touch a server, a dashboard you do not understand, or a line of code.'],
];
---
<Base>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid">
<div>
<span class="kicker-chip">Web design studio · Toronto, Canada — working worldwide</span>
<h1 style="margin-top:20px">Your business, online — <span class="grad">designed, built and run</span> by one team.</h1>
<p class="sub">{BRAND_NAME} designs, builds and looks after websites, online stores and apps — so your business gets more enquiries and more sales, without you touching any tech.</p>
<p class="tech">For technical teams, the same team does managed hosting, cloud, Kubernetes &amp; OpenShift, AI and compliance readiness — scroll down for the technical detail.</p>
<div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href={`${BASE}/contact`}>Start a Project →</a><a class="btn ghost" href={`${BASE}/work`}>See our work</a></div>
<p class="micro"><b>10–20 designers</b> · Typical website launch <b>4–6 weeks</b> · <b>Custom quote</b> — you know what fits before you commit</p>
</div>
<div class="mock" aria-label="Example of a website we build">
<div class="mock-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>yourbusiness.com</span></div>
<div class="mock-body">
<div class="m-h"></div>
<div class="m-p"></div><div class="m-p short"></div>
<span class="mock-btn">Get a quote →</span>
<div class="mock-stats">
<div><b>&lt;1.5s</b><span>Load-time target, every site</span></div>
<div><b>100%</b><span>Mobile-first, responsive</span></div>
<div><b>4–6 wks</b><span>Typical launch</span></div>
<div><b>You own it</b><span>Domain, site &amp; data</span></div>
</div>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft);margin:12px 0 0">A sample layout, not a client site. Real client work lands on the Work page as it ships.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="answer tight"><div class="container"><div class="answer-grid">
<div class="answer-card"><b>What we do</b><span>Design, build and run your website, store or app — plus hosting, cloud and AI when you need them.</span></div>
<div class="answer-card"><b>Who it's for</b><span>Small businesses, growing stores, and technical teams — in Canada and worldwide.</span></div>
<div class="answer-card"><b>What you get</b><span>A fast, mobile-first site you own, on the platform the world uses. No templates, no lock-in.</span></div>
<div class="answer-card"><b>What it costs</b><span>Custom quote. Tell us your budget — we tell you what fits, before you commit.</span></div>
<div class="answer-card"><b>What happens next</b><span>1 · Tell us your goal → 2 · We show you what fits → 3 · You decide.</span></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="tight"><div class="container">
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><b>10–20</b><span>Designers, developers &amp; strategists on your project team — you talk to the people doing the work.</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>4–6<em> wks</em></b><span>Typical website, first call to launch. Focused builds with ready content: 3 weeks.</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>&lt;1.5<em>s</em></b><span>Load-time target for every site we build. Speed is a feature, not an add-on.</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>38.6<em>%</em></b><span>Of the web runs on WordPress — the platform most of our sites are built on. <small>Source: W3Techs, Nov 2026. Shopify 5.4% · Wix 4.2% · Squarespace 2.4%.</small></span></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section style="background:var(--bg)"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who it's for</p><h2>Three kinds of client. One team.</h2><p class="lead">If you recognise yourself here, you are in the right place. If you don't, tell us anyway — we'll say so honestly.</p></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Non-technical · most common</span><h3>“I just want a website that works.”</h3><p>You run a business, not a website. You want more calls, more bookings, more sales — and you never want to hear the word “server”. <strong>Start with:</strong> Web Design or Website Builder.</p><a href={`${BASE}/services/website-services`}>Website Services →</a></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Growing store</span><h3>“My store needs to sell more.”</h3><p>You sell online and the store is leaking sales — slow pages, a checkout that drops people, no time to fix it. <strong>Start with:</strong> eCommerce Setup + Managed WordPress.</p><a href={`${BASE}/services/ecommerce`}>eCommerce Setup →</a></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Technical team</span><h3>“We need cloud, done properly.”</h3><p>You run real infrastructure — Kubernetes, OpenShift, compliance — and you want specialists who run it every day, with guardrails and a handover. <strong>Start with:</strong> Professional Services.</p><a href={`${BASE}/services/professional-services`}>Professional Services →</a></div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Everything you need to launch, run and grow online — in one team.</h2><p class="lead">Three silos. Pick the one that matches your problem — every service inside it has its own page, its own deliverables, and a custom quote.</p></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="card silo"><span class="tag">For businesses</span><h3>Website Services</h3><p class="plain">A website, store or app your customers love — and you can edit yourself.</p><p class="tech">Custom design &amp; UX on WordPress, Shopify, Wix or Squarespace; no-code apps in FlutterFlow / Adalo.</p><ul><li>Web Design</li><li>UX Design</li><li>Website Builder</li><li>No-Code App Builder</li><li>eCommerce Setup</li></ul><a href={`${BASE}/services/website-services`}>Explore Website Services →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><span class="tag">For sites that must stay up</span><h3>Managed Hosting</h3><p class="plain">Hosting that just works. Set up, secured, backed up and watched — you never touch a server.</p><p class="tech">Managed WordPress, VPS and dedicated servers; daily backups, SSL, monitoring.</p><ul><li>Managed WordPress</li><li>Managed VPS</li><li>Dedicated Servers</li></ul><a href={`${BASE}/services/managed-hosting`}>Explore Managed Hosting →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><span class="tag">For technical teams</span><h3>Professional Services</h3><p class="plain">Cloud, containers and compliance, done properly — by specialists, with a clear handover.</p><p class="tech">Cloud landing zones, managed Kubernetes &amp; OpenShift, AI, compliance readiness (not certification), staffing.</p><ul><li>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</li><li>Managed Kubernetes &amp; OpenShift</li><li>Compliance Readiness</li><li>AI Consulting &amp; Staffing</li></ul><a href={`${BASE}/services/professional-services`}>Explore Professional Services →</a></div>
</div></div></section>

<section style="background:var(--bg)"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why us, honestly</p><h2>How we compare — before you ask.</h2><p class="lead">You are already comparing us with a big agency, a freelancer, or doing it yourself. Here is the honest comparison.</p></div>
<div style="overflow-x:auto"><table class="compare">
<tr><th></th><th class="hl">{BRAND_NAME}</th><th>Big agency</th><th>Freelancer</th><th>DIY builder</th></tr>
<tr><td>Custom design</td><td class="hl">Yes — designed for you, no templates</td><td>Yes</td><td>Often, varies</td><td>No — you pick a template</td></tr>
<tr><td>Typical launch</td><td class="hl">4–6 weeks</td><td>8–20 weeks</td><td>2–8 weeks, varies</td><td>Days — if you do the work</td></tr>
<tr><td>Do you touch a server?</td><td class="hl">Never — we run it</td><td>Usually not</td><td>Often you do</td><td>You do, or you pay extra</td></tr>
<tr><td>Who do you talk to?</td><td class="hl">The people doing the work</td><td>An account manager</td><td>One person, if available</td><td>Support chat</td></tr>
<tr><td>After launch</td><td class="hl">Hosting, updates &amp; care included</td><td>Usually a separate retainer</td><td>Varies</td><td>You maintain it</td></tr>
<tr><td>Price clarity</td><td class="hl">Custom quote, in writing, before you commit</td><td>Quote after a long sales process</td><td>Quote, varies</td><td>Monthly fee + your time</td></tr>
</table></div>
<p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:14px">Comparison is qualitative, based on how these options normally work — not a claim about any named competitor's price.</p>
</div></section>

<section><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Work</p><h2>Sample builds — first client stories coming.</h2><p class="lead">We are a new team shipping our first client work. These are sample builds from our team, showing what we build and how — not client results. Real client stories land here as they ship, with real names and real numbers.</p></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="work-card"><div class="art"><span class="pill">Sample build · Website</span><b>Clinic website, redesigned</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Built for:</strong> a local clinic that needed clear services and easy booking. <strong>Stack:</strong> WordPress, custom design. <strong>Target:</strong> under 1.5s load, phone-first.</p><a href={`${BASE}/work`}>See how we build →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0E3A5C,var(--accent))"><span class="pill">Sample build · Store</span><b>Online store, rebuilt</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Built for:</strong> a small shop whose checkout was losing sales. <strong>Stack:</strong> Shopify, rebuilt checkout. <strong>Target:</strong> faster pages, fewer drop-offs.</p><a href={`${BASE}/work`}>See how we build →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2A1B6E,#14305E)"><span class="pill">Sample build · Service site</span><b>Service business site</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Built for:</strong> a service business that lived on phone calls. <strong>Stack:</strong> custom design, clear call buttons. <strong>Target:</strong> under 1.5s load, calls in one tap.</p><a href={`${BASE}/work`}>See how we build →</a></div></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:20px"><a href={`${BASE}/work`}>See all work →</a></p></div></section>

<section style="background:var(--bg)"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why {BRAND_NAME}</p><h2>One team, start to finish.</h2></div>
<div class="why">
<div class="card"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>No hand-offs</h3><p>Design, build, hosting and care — one team, no messages lost between vendors. You talk to the people doing the work.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></div><h3>Fast by default</h3><p>Every site is built to load in under 1.5 seconds. Speed is a feature, not an add-on — and it is measured, not claimed.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h3>You own everything</h3><p>Your domain, your site, your data. No lock-in, ever — your accounts, in your name.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>From first call to launch in 4–6 weeks.</h2><p class="lead">Five steps. At every step you know what you do, and what you get.</p></div>
<div class="steps">
<div class="step"><b>01</b><h3>Discover</h3><p>Week 1 — we learn your business, your customers and your goals.</p><div class="you"><b>You do:</b> one 45-min call + a short brief.</div></div>
<div class="step"><b>02</b><h3>Design</h3><p>Weeks 2–3 — wireframes, then visual design. You see it on desktop and phone.</p><div class="you"><b>You do:</b> 2 rounds of feedback.</div></div>
<div class="step"><b>03</b><h3>Build</h3><p>Weeks 3–5 — design becomes a fast, working site. SEO, speed and accessibility built in.</p><div class="you"><b>You do:</b> approve content.</div></div>
<div class="step"><b>04</b><h3>Launch</h3><p>Week 5–6 — every page tested, hosting and analytics set up, then live.</p><div class="you"><b>You do:</b> nothing — we handle it.</div></div>
<div class="step"><b>05</b><h3>Care</h3><p>Ongoing — hosting, updates, backups and small changes, every month.</p><div class="you"><b>You do:</b> run your business.</div></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:20px"><a href={`${BASE}/process`}>See the full process →</a></p></div></section>

<section style="background:var(--bg)"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What it costs</p><h2>Custom quote — and honest about what changes it.</h2><p class="lead">We don't publish a price we haven't settled, and we don't hide the price behind a sales call. These are the things that move the quote — tell us your budget, and we'll tell you what fits, in writing, before you commit.</p></div>
<div class="cost">
<table>
<tr><th>What changes the price</th><th>How</th></tr>
<tr><td>Number of pages</td><td>More pages, more design and content work</td></tr>
<tr><td>Online store</td><td>Products, payments, shipping and tax setup</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mobile app</td><td>iOS + Android publishing, logins, payments</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hosting &amp; care</td><td>Managed hosting, updates, backups, small changes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cloud / compliance</td><td>Scoped per project — quoted after a short review</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="note blue"><strong>Your budget is the starting point, not a secret.</strong><br/>Put your budget in the form — Under $5k, $5–15k, $15–50k, $50k+, or Not sure — and we'll reply within 1 business day with what fits. If we can't help, we'll say so and point you to what can.</div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What clients say</p><h2>First stories coming.</h2><p class="lead">We are a new team shipping our first client work. Our first client stories land here — real quotes, real names, no invented testimonials.</p></div>
<blockquote style="font-size:24px;color:var(--navy);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding-left:22px;max-width:760px">“We build the site we'd want to use ourselves — fast, clear, and honest.”<footer style="font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">— The {BRAND_NAME} team</footer></blockquote>
</div></section>

<section style="background:var(--bg)"><div class="container faq"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Before you ask.</h2></div>
{faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f[0]}</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">{f[1]}</p></details>)}
</div></section>
</Base>
